### Welcome API — declared in src/contracts/welcome.contract.ts
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### In development the X-Frontend-Key header is not required; in production it is.

### 1. Hello
GET http://localhost:3000/api/welcome

###

### 2. Hello, by name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/welcome/Ada

###

### 3. Too long a name — the contract answers 400 VALIDATION_ERROR before the handler runs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/welcome/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

###

### 4. With the frontend key (what production requires)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/welcome
X-Frontend-Key: {{frontendKey}}

###

### Health check (not behind the frontend key)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### API index — every endpoint, with its method and auth for contract routes
GET http://localhost:3000/api
